msgstr "想了解哪方面的内容呢？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1392
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ExplainContests"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON CONTEST involves four\n"
"TRAINERS entering one POKéMON each\l"
"in competitive judging.\p"
"A CONTEST has two stages of judging,\n"
"primary and secondary.\p"
"Primary judging is a popularity poll\n"
"involving the audience.\p"
"Secondary judging features appeals\n"
"by the POKéMON using their moves.\p"
"Plan appeals carefully to earn the\n"
"most attention of the JUDGE and\l"
"excite the audience.\l"
"Do your best to stand out.\p"
"The primary and secondary scores are\n"
"added at the end.\p"
"The POKéMON garnering the highest\n"
"score is declared the winner.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦华丽大赛是由4位训练家\n"
"各派出1只宝可梦参加的比赛。\p"
"华丽大赛分为两轮审查：\n"
"第一轮审查和第二轮审查。\p"
"第一轮审查是\n"
"由观众投票的人气评选。\p"
"第二轮审查是宝可梦\n"
"使用招式进行表演。\p"
"要仔细安排表演，\n"
"吸引评审的注意，\l"
"让观众兴奋起来。\l"
"尽全力展现自己吧。\p"
"最后会把第一轮和\n"
"第二轮的分数加起来。\p"
"得分最高的宝可梦\n"
"就是优胜者。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1411
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ExplainContestTypes"
msgid ""
"There are five kinds of CONTESTS.\p"
"COOL, BEAUTY, CUTE, SMART, and\n"
"TOUGH are the five categories.\p"
"Choose the CONTEST that is right for\n"
"the POKéMON you plan to enter.$"
msgstr ""
"华丽大赛共有五种。\p"
"分别是帅气、美丽、可爱、\n"
"聪明和强壮五个类别。\p"
"请选择适合参赛宝可梦的\n"
"华丽大赛吧。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1418
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ExplainContestRanks"
msgid ""
"There are four ranks of POKéMON\n"
"CONTESTS.\p"
"NORMAL, SUPER, HYPER, and MASTER\n"
"are the four ranks.\p"
"In the NORMAL Rank, any POKéMON may\n"
"enter.\p"
"Any POKéMON that won a NORMAL Rank\n"
"CONTEST may move up to the SUPER Rank\l"
"in the same category.\p"
"In the same way, a SUPER Rank winner\n"
"can move up to the HYPER Rank, and\l"
"a HYPER Rank winner can advance to\l"
"the MASTER Rank in the same category.\p"
"A POKéMON that won in the MASTER Rank\n"
"may compete in the MASTER Rank as\l"
"often as its TRAINER wants.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦华丽大赛共有四个级别。\p"
"分别是普通级、超级、\n"
"高级和大师级。\p"
"任何宝可梦都可以\n"
"参加普通级的比赛。\p"
"在普通级华丽大赛中获胜的宝可梦，\n"
"可以参加同一类别的超级比赛。\p"
"同样，超级的优胜者可以晋级到\n"
"高级，高级的优胜者\l"
"可以晋级到同一类别的大师级。\p"
"在大师级获胜过的宝可梦，\n"
"只要训练家愿意，\l"
"可以无数次参加大师级的比赛。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1436
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EnterWhichRank"
msgid "Which Rank would you like to enter?$"
msgstr "要参加哪个级别呢？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1439
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EnterWhichContest1"
msgid "Which CONTEST would you like to enter?$"
msgstr "要参加哪种华丽大赛呢？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1442
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EnterWhichPokemon1"
msgid "Which POKéMON would you like to enter?$"
msgstr "要让哪只宝可梦参加呢？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1445
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_MonNotQualifiedForRank"
msgid ""
"I'm terribly sorry, but your POKéMON\n"
"is not qualified to compete at this\l"
"Rank yet…$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉，你的宝可梦\n"
"还没有资格参加\l"
"这个级别的比赛……$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1450
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EggCannotTakePart"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but an EGG cannot take part\n"
"in a POKéMON CONTEST.$"
msgstr ""
"抱歉，蛋是不能参加\n"
"宝可梦华丽大赛的。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1454
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_MonInNoConditionForContest"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON appears to be in no\n"
"condition to take part in a CONTEST…$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦好像\n"
"没办法参加华丽大赛……$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1458
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_AlreadyWonEnterAnyway"
msgid ""
"Oh, but that RIBBON…\p"
"Your POKéMON has won this CONTEST\n"
"before, hasn't it?\p"
"Would you like to enter it in this\n"
"CONTEST anyway?$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，那个奖章……\p"
"你的宝可梦以前\n"
"在这个华丽大赛中获胜过吧？\p"
"即使这样，\n"
"也还要参加这个华丽大赛吗？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1465
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ConfirmContestMon"
msgid "Is that your CONTEST POKéMON?$"
msgstr "要让这只宝可梦参加吗？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1468
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_YourMonIsEntryNum4"
msgid ""
"Okay, your POKéMON will be entered\n"
"in this CONTEST.\p"
"Your POKéMON is Entry No. 4.\n"
"The CONTEST will begin shortly.$"
msgstr ""
"好的，你的宝可梦\n"
"将参加这次华丽大赛。\p"
"你的宝可梦是4号参赛者。\n"
"华丽大赛马上就要开始了。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1474
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ComeThroughHere"
msgid ""
"Please come in through here.\n"
"Good luck!$"
msgstr ""
"请从这边进去。\n"
"祝你好运！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1478
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_PokemonWonWeHavePrize"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! Your POKéMON is the\n"
"CONTEST winner!\p"
"We have your prize right here.\n"
"Please, right this way!$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你！你的宝可梦\n"
"在华丽大赛中获胜了！\p"
"奖品就在这里。\n"
"请往这边走！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1484
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ComeBackForPrizeLater"
msgid ""
"Please come back for your prize\n"
"later on.$"
msgstr ""
"请稍后再来\n"
"领取奖品。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1488
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_GettingStartedParticipantsAsFollows"
msgid ""
