"【{STR_VAR_3}】宝可梦{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"现在开始了！\p"
"参赛的训练家和宝可梦\n"
"介绍如下：$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1495
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_GettingStartedParticipantsAsFollowsLink"
msgid ""
"MC: Hello! We're just getting started\n"
"with a 4-player linked POKéMON\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"The participating TRAINERS and their\n"
"POKéMON are as follows:$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：大家好！4人连接的\n"
"宝可梦{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"现在开始了！\p"
"参赛的训练家和宝可梦\n"
"介绍如下：$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1502
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_EntryXTrainersMon"
msgid ""
"MC: Entry No. {STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}'s {STR_VAR_3}!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：{STR_VAR_2}号参赛者！\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}的{STR_VAR_3}！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1506
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_SeenContestantsAudienceWillVote"
msgid ""
"MC: We've just seen the four POKéMON\n"
"contestants.\p"
"Now it's time for primary judging!\p"
"The audience will vote on their\n"
"favorite POKéMON contestants.\p"
"Without any further ado, let the\n"
"voting begin!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：4只参赛的宝可梦\n"
"已经全部登场了。\p"
"接下来是第一轮审查！\p"
"观众将投票选出\n"
"自己喜欢的参赛宝可梦。\p"
"事不宜迟，\n"
"投票开始！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1515
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_VotingUnderWay"
msgid "Voting under way…$"
msgstr "投票进行中……$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1518
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_VotingCompleteLetsAppeal"
msgid ""
"Voting is now complete!\p"
"While the votes are being tallied,\n"
"let's move on to secondary judging!\p"
"The second stage of judging is the\n"
"much anticipated appeal time!\p"
"May the contestants amaze us with\n"
"superb appeals of dazzling moves!\p"
"Let's see a little enthusiasm!\n"
"Let's appeal!$"
msgstr ""
"投票结束了！\p"
"在统计票数期间，\n"
"让我们进入第二轮审查！\p"
"第二轮审查就是\n"
"大家期待已久的表演时间！\p"
"希望参赛者们能用华丽的招式\n"
"带来精彩的表演，让我们惊叹！\p"
"让我们热情高涨起来吧！\n"
"开始表演！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1529
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_ThatsItForJudging"
msgid "MC: That's it for judging!$"
msgstr "主持人：审查到此结束！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1532
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_ThankYouForAppeals"
msgid ""
"Thank you all for a most wonderful\n"
"display of quality appeals!\p"
"This concludes all judging!\n"
"Thank you for your fine efforts!$"
msgstr ""
"感谢大家带来了\n"
"如此精彩的表演！\p"
"所有审查到此结束！\n"
"感谢大家的努力！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1538
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_JudgeLooksReady"
msgid ""
"Now, all that remains is the pulse-\n"
"pounding proclamation of the winner.\p"
"The JUDGE looks ready to make\n"
"the announcement!$"
msgstr ""
"现在，只剩下令人心跳加速的\n"
"优胜者发表了。\p"
"评审好像已经准备好\n"
"宣布结果了！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1544
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_WeWillNowDeclareWinner"
msgid "JUDGE: We will now declare the winner!$"
msgstr "评审：现在宣布优胜者！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1547
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_CongratsTrainerXandMon"
msgid ""
"MC: Entry No. {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"{STR_VAR_3} and {STR_VAR_1},\n"
"congratulations!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：{STR_VAR_2}号参赛者！\p"
"{STR_VAR_3}和{STR_VAR_1}，\n"
"恭喜你们！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1552
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_CongratsPleaseCompeteAgain"
msgid ""
"MC: Congratulations!\n"
"Please do compete again!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：恭喜你！\n"
"欢迎再来参加！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1556
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_AcceptYourPrize"
msgid ""
"MC: Here you are!\n"
"Please accept your prize!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：给你！\n"
"请收下你的奖品！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1560
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_ConferRibbonAsPrize"
msgid ""
"We confer on you this RIBBON\n"
"as your prize!$"
msgstr ""
"我们将这枚奖章\n"
"作为奖品授予你！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1564
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_ReceivedRibbon"
msgid "{PLAYER} received a RIBBON.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}得到了奖章。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1567
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_PutRibbonOnMon"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} put the RIBBON on\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}把奖章\n"
"戴在了{STR_VAR_1}身上。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1571
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_PickUpPrizeAtCounterLater"
msgid ""
"Please pick up your prize at\n"
"the reception counter later.\l"
"Please do compete again!$"
msgstr ""
"请稍后到报名处\n"
"领取奖品。\l"
"欢迎再来参加！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1577
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_OnlyRegister4Players"
msgid ""
"I only register four players for\n"
"POKéMON CONTESTS.\p"
"If three other players link up, all\n"
"four may enter the same CONTEST.\p"
"Would you like to take part?$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦华丽大赛\n"
"我这里只受理4名玩家报名。\p"
"如果有另外3名玩家连接，\n"
"4人就能参加同一个华丽大赛。\p"
"要参加吗？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1584
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ProgressWillBeSaved"
msgid ""
"Before entering a CONTEST, your\n"
"progress will be saved.$"
msgstr ""
"参加华丽大赛之前，\n"
"会先记录游戏进度。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1588
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ParticipateAnotherTime"
msgid ""
"We hope you will participate another\n"
"time.$"
msgstr "希望你下次再来参加。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1593
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EnterContest2"
msgid "Would you like to enter a CONTEST?$"
msgstr "要参加华丽大赛吗？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1597
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_Explain4PlayerContest"
msgid ""
"When four players are ready, connect\n"
"over a Game Link cable, and register\l"
"with me, please.\p"
"Please choose the same CONTEST\n"
"as your fellow contestants.\p"
"The CONTEST begins as soon as all\n"
"players register their entry.\p"
"After that, the usual CONTEST rules\n"
"apply.$"
msgstr ""
"4名玩家准备好后，\n"
"请用GBA连接线连接，\l"
"然后到我这里报名。\p"
"请和其他参赛者\n"
"选择同一个华丽大赛。\p"
"所有玩家都报名后，\n"
"华丽大赛就会开始。\p"
"之后，就按照平常的\n"
"华丽大赛规则进行。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1609
