#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1664
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EnterWhichContest3"
msgid "Which CONTEST would you like to enter?$"
msgstr "要参加哪种华丽大赛呢？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1667
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_MonInNoCondition2"
msgid ""
"Your POKéMON appears to be in no\n"
"condition to take part in a CONTEST…$"
msgstr ""
"你的宝可梦好像\n"
"没办法参加华丽大赛……$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1671
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EggCannotTakePart2"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but an EGG cannot take part\n"
"in a POKéMON CONTEST.$"
msgstr ""
"抱歉，蛋是不能参加\n"
"宝可梦华丽大赛的。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1675
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_EnterWhichPokemon3"
msgid "Which POKéMON would you like to enter?$"
msgstr "要让哪只宝可梦参加呢？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1678
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_PleaseDecideLinkLeader"
msgid ""
"Please decide which of you will\n"
"become the GROUP LEADER.\p"
"The other players must then choose\n"
"“JOIN GROUP.”$"
msgstr ""
"请决定由谁来担任组长。\p"
"其他玩家请选择\n"
"“加入小组”。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1684
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_PlayerAt4PCounterUseGMode"
msgid ""
"At least one player has entered using\n"
"the 4-player reception counter.\p"
"There must be four players connected\n"
"using a GBA Game Link cable.\p"
"When the four players are ready,\n"
"select G-MODE (GLOBAL MODE),\l"
"then register to enter again, please.$"
msgstr ""
"有玩家是在4人报名处\n"
"报名的。\p"
"必须使用GBA连接线\n"
"连接4名玩家。\p"
"4名玩家准备好后，\n"
"请选择G模式（全球模式），\l"
"然后重新报名。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1693
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ExplainLinkContest"
msgid ""
"This is a CONTEST for two to four\n"
"players linked using a Wireless\l"
"Adapter or a GBA Game Link cable.\p"
"Participants are first asked to choose\n"
"the mode they wish to enter.\p"
"There are two different modes.\p"
"E-MODE (EMERALD MODE) is for\n"
"two to four players, each with a\l"
"POKéMON Emerald Game Pak.\p"
"G-MODE (GLOBAL MODE) is only for\n"
"four players, each with a POKéMON\l"
"Emerald, Ruby, or Sapphire Game Pak.\p"
"The players should discuss which mode\n"
"they want, then choose the same mode.\p"
"Once all the players have chosen\n"
"the same CONTEST in the same mode,\l"
"the entry registration is complete.\p"
"After that, a CONTEST will start in\n"
"the usual manner.$"
msgstr ""
"这是使用无线适配器或GBA连接线\n"
"连接2～4名玩家参加的华丽大赛。\p"
"参赛者首先要选择\n"
"想要参加的模式。\p"
"模式有两种。\p"
"E模式（绿宝石模式）\n"
"适用于2～4名持有\l"
"《宝可梦 绿宝石》卡带的玩家。\p"
"G模式（全球模式）只适用于\n"
"4名持有《宝可梦 绿宝石》、\l"
"《红宝石》或《蓝宝石》卡带的玩家。\p"
"玩家们应该商量好要选哪个模式，\n"
"然后选择相同的模式。\p"
"所有玩家都在相同模式下\n"
"选择了同一个华丽大赛后，\l"
"报名就完成了。\p"
"之后，华丽大赛就会\n"
"按照平常的方式开始。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1714
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ExplainEMode"
msgid ""
"In E-MODE (EMERALD MODE),\n"
"a LINK CONTEST can be held with\l"
"two to four players. Each player must\l"
"have a POKéMON Emerald Game Pak.\p"
"The players must be linked with each\n"
"other using Wireless Adapters or\l"
"GBA Game Link cables.\p"
"If there are fewer than four players,\n"
"TRAINERS in the hall will join to fill\l"
"the 4-player CONTEST lineup.\p"
"Please be aware that E-MODE is not\n"
"available in POKéMON Ruby or Sapphire.$"
msgstr ""
"在E模式（绿宝石模式）中，\n"
"2～4名玩家可以举行\l"
"连接华丽大赛。每位玩家都必须\l"
"持有《宝可梦 绿宝石》卡带。\p"
"玩家之间必须使用无线适配器\n"
"或GBA连接线进行连接。\p"
"如果玩家不足4名，\n"
"会场里的训练家会加入，\l"
"凑满4人参赛。\p"
"请注意，《宝可梦 红宝石》和\n"
"《蓝宝石》无法使用E模式。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1728
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ExplainGMode"
msgid ""
"G-MODE (GLOBAL MODE) is specifically\n"
"for four players who are linked using\l"
"GBA Game Link cables.\p"
"Each player must have a POKéMON\n"
"Emerald, Ruby, or Sapphire Game Pak.\p"
"The CONTEST starts after all players\n"
"choose G-MODE (POKéMON Emerald) or\l"
"enter through the 4-player reception\l"
"counter (POKéMON Ruby or Sapphire).$"
msgstr ""
"G模式（全球模式）专门用于\n"
"使用GBA连接线连接的4名玩家。\p"
"每位玩家都必须持有\n"
"《宝可梦 绿宝石》、《红宝石》\l"
"或《蓝宝石》的卡带。\p"
"所有玩家都选择了G模式\n"
"（《宝可梦 绿宝石》），或通过\l"
"4人报名处报名（《红宝石》\l"
"或《蓝宝石》）后，\l"
"华丽大赛就会开始。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1739
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_NoWirelessAdapterInGMode"
msgid ""
"I'm terribly sorry.\p"
"G-MODE does not function\n"
"with Wireless Adapters.\p"
"Please select E-MODE or try\n"
"again using a GBA Game Link cable.$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉。\p"
"G模式无法使用\n"
"无线适配器。\p"
"请选择E模式，或者\n"
"使用GBA连接线再试一次。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1746
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_WhichContestMode"
msgid ""
"Which CONTEST MODE would you like\n"
"to enter?$"
msgstr "要以哪种华丽大赛模式参加呢？$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1750
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_GettingStartedWireless"
msgid ""
"MC: Hello! We're just getting started\n"
"with a 4-player linked POKéMON\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：大家好！4人连接的\n"
"宝可梦{STR_VAR_2}\l"
"现在开始了！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1755
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_ParticipantsAsFollows"
msgid ""
"The participating TRAINERS and their\n"
"POKéMON are as follows:$"
msgstr ""
"参赛的训练家和宝可梦\n"
"介绍如下：$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1759
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_WeveSeenContestants"
msgid ""
"MC: We've just seen the four POKéMON\n"
"contestants.\p"
"Now it's time for primary judging!$"
msgstr ""
"主持人：4只参赛的宝可梦\n"
"已经全部登场了。\p"
"接下来是第一轮审查！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1764
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_AudienceWillVote"
msgid ""
"The audience will vote on their\n"
"favorite POKéMON contestants.$"
msgstr ""
"观众将投票选出\n"
"自己喜欢的参赛宝可梦。$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1768
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_LetVotingBegin"
msgid ""
"Without any further ado,\n"
"let the voting begin!$"
msgstr ""
"事不宜迟，\n"
"投票开始！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1772
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_VotingComplete"
msgid ""
"Voting is now complete!\p"
"While the votes are being tallied,\n"
"let's move on to secondary judging!$"
msgstr ""
"投票结束了！\p"
"在统计票数期间，\n"
"让我们进入第二轮审查！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1777
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_SecondStageOfJudging"
msgid ""
"The second stage of judging is\n"
"the much-anticipated appeal time!\p"
"May the contestants amaze us with\n"
"superb appeals of dazzling moves!$"
msgstr ""
"第二轮审查就是\n"
"大家期待已久的表演时间！\p"
"希望参赛者们能用华丽的招式\n"
"带来精彩的表演，让我们惊叹！$"

#: data/scripts/contest_hall.inc:1783
msgctxt "ContestHall_Text_LetsAppeal"
msgid ""
"Let's see a little enthusiasm!\n"
"Let's appeal!$"
msgstr ""
"让我们热情高涨起来吧！\n"
"开始表演！$"
